  <p class="forest-description">
    “Wash. Dry. Grow.” is Bichin Laundry Equipment’s CSR-driven
    campaign. For every equipment purchase, we plant trees on behalf
    of our clients as part of our commitment to reducing carbon
    emissions and giving back to the planet.
    We are an authorized distributor specializing in the sales,
    service, and support of complete commercial and industrial
    laundry solutions. We proudly serve customers across British
    Columbia and Yukon, including care homes, hotels, non-profit
    housing providers, and laundromats.
    Through this initiative, we aim to contribute to the
    reforestation of our home, British Columbia while supporting the
    communities we serve.
  </p>
